				'section_6_tip_1_text': 'Increase the number of orders you receive per customer easily with our StampCard program.It is a simple but effective way to keep your customers happy because they get rewarded for ordering.{br}\r\n{br}\r\nWith each order your customer places, he receives a virtual stamp, which is stored in their stamps card. Once the customer has collected 5 stamps, he receives a voucher with a value of 10% of the total order amount of these five orders. This voucher can only be used at your restaurant.{br}\r\n{br}\r\nDo you want to join our stamp cards program? Click on the \"Join the Program\" button below.{br}\r\n{br}\r\nThe registration for the StampCard program is free of charge. You will only have to cover the 10% off that your customers receive after collecting the 5 stamps. When the customer redeems his discount code with an order at your restaurant, the discount will be shown on your invoice as \"paid by stamp card\"{br}\r\n{br}\r\nJoin our StampCard now and reward your customers for their loyalty!',
				'section_6_heading': 'StampCard',
				'section_5_tip_2_title': 'View my TopRank position',
				'section_5_tip_2_text': 'View your position with and without TopRank activated in the ‘My Campaign’ section under TopRank.',
				'section_5_tip_1_title': 'Upgrade your position to increase orders',
				'section_5_tip_1_text': 'TopRank is an easy and quick way to boost your ranking on our platform and increase your orders. With TopRank you bid to appear higher on the restaurant list. \r\n{br}\r\nStart your campaign in just a few clicks. TopRank gives you flexibility over when you want to be more visible and control over how much you pay. You only pay a fee when you receive an order while TopRank is activated. \r\n{br}\r\nBoost your orders now and activate TopRank. \r\n{br}',
				'section_5_heading': 'TopRank',
				'section_4_tip_4_title': 'Receive orders, hassle-free',
				'section_4_tip_4_text': 'Your customers appreciate the convenience of ordering and paying online. Online payments are not only safer for customers, but also safer for your deliverers. When you add these benefits, you increase the likelihood that people will order your food.{br}\r\n{br}\r\nYou can also use technology to make your life easier in the restaurant. Use T-connect or the Takeaway Box to receive your orders. Both systems are highly reliable and will ensure that orders get to you in real time.',
				'section_4_tip_3_title': 'Increase your customer loyalty',
				'section_4_tip_3_text': 'Loyal customers should be rewarded. Start your loyalty initiative, such as joining our StampCard program, and see your returning customer base grow! Loyal customers are also likely to recommend your restaurant - helping you to boost your business in the long term. ',
				'section_4_tip_2_title': 'Tell everyone that you deliver',
				'section_4_tip_2_text': 'Are your clients aware of the fact that your restaurant delivers?\r\n{br}\r\n{br}\r\nBeing on @:(site_name) offers you a lot of visibility, but in order to boost your sales, you need to let all your customers know that they can get the meals they love delivered at their doorsteps.\r\n{br}\r\n{br}\r\nWe’re excited to introduce our new Order Now Tools for your restaurant: our free tools to help you drive even more orders via your online and offline marketing channels.\r\n{br}\r\n{br}\r\nIn just a few clicks, you can now generate your unique ‘Order Now’ button and QR code to use on your restaurant’s website, social media, in-store signage, direct-mailers, flyers, packaging, and more.\r\n{br}\r\n{br}\r\nWith a quick click of a button or scan of the QR code, customers can instantly order from your restaurant\'s page on our platform.',
				'section_4_tip_1_title': 'Boost your online presence',
				'section_4_tip_1_text': 'When you sign up with us, we are going to help you get started with online marketing. We help each of our partners with their online findability such as: getting a mini website and being listed on Google. Besides all this, we offer a wide range of marketing services such as: outdoor advertising, TV commercials, social media marketing, consumer vouchers and much more.{br}\r\n{br}\r\nBut this is not always enough. Creating an online presence will help your restaurant in the long run. Even though you don\'t have a lot of time and finances, you can aways take advantage of the free resources that the internet offers. For example, you can create a social media account where your customers can connect with you and where you share your offers and discounts. A social media account, wether is Twitter, Facebook or Instagram, will give you an extra medium where you can engage with your customers, all with the end goal of increasing your brand awareness.',
				'section_4_heading': 'Marketing tips',
				'section_3_tip_4_title': 'Add healthy options',
				'section_3_tip_4_text': 'Healthy and vegetarian food trends have taken over the food industry in the last few years. Keep up with consumer demands and diets by offering healthy and meat-free options. You can attract a wider range of customers and help boost your orders.',
				'section_3_tip_3_title': 'Update your menu to satisfy your customers',
				'section_3_tip_3_text': 'Offer the best range of dishes by regularly updating your menu. Remove and replace items that don’t sell. Customers will find the dishes they love much faster and will have new options to try out.',
				'section_3_tip_2_title': 'Offer exclusive deals',
				'section_3_tip_2_text': 'Make constant improvements to your menu and reward your customers with exclusive offers. Via the Restaurant Portal you have the option of adding discounts to your restaurant such as: pizza of the day for €6 or 20% off dessert items in the weekend, or {meal_deals_link}. Restaurants which offer discounts are featured prominently on @:(site_name) and get more traffic from customers. ',
				'section_3_tip_1_title': 'Choose your menu carefully',
				'section_3_tip_1_text': 'Give your customers a better experience by offering delivery-friendly food. Choose your tastiest and most popular dishes for your online menu. Also, you should ensure that your dishes will not take too long to prepare and will stay fresh during the delivery journey. ',
				'section_3_heading': 'Menu & Offers',
				'section_2_tip_2_title': 'Encourage good reviews',
				'section_2_tip_2_text': 'Good reviews are a sign of happy customers. Positive reviews are also advantageous in helping you to get more orders. Keep your customers satisfied and encourage them to review their order on @:(site_name).\r\n{br}\r\nReceived a negative review? Most of the time this can be prevented. Make sure you use only the best quality products and food for your orders and set realistic delivery times.',
				'section_2_tip_1_title': 'Focus on Quality',
				'section_2_tip_1_text': 'Quality services mean happy customers and happy customers is what every restaurant wants. Therefore, you should take a look at your services and find new ways to improve. ',
				'section_2_heading': 'Reviews',
				'section_1_tip_3_title': 'Lower or eliminate delivery costs and the minimum order amount',
				'section_1_tip_3_text': 'Setting a low minimum order amount and charging lower delivery costs could attract new customers. Have you considered doing this already? It could increase your orders. Remember, we also offer the option of having different delivery costs per delivery area on our website.',
				'section_1_tip_2_title': 'Expand your delivery area',
				'section_1_tip_2_text': 'We know that you prefer fast, close to your restaurant deliveries, but extending your delivery area can have a great impact on orders. Increasing your delivery area just one kilometer might have a drastic influence on the number of orders you receive. Some areas are serviced quite well, while other areas  might have very few delivery options for customers. Starting delivery in areas with only a few other restaurants could be well worth the extra effort.',
				'section_1_tip_1_title': 'Adjust your delivery times & opening hours',
				'section_1_tip_1_text': 'Your opening hours can have an impact on your restaurant’s success. Late-night and lunch orders have increased meaning restaurants open during these times receive more orders on average, per day. Consider adjusting your opening hours to increase your orders - you can do this in the ‘My Restaurant’ section. ',
				'section_1_heading': 'Delivery tips',
				'section4_title': 'Lower or eliminate delivery costs and the minimum order amount',
				'section4_paragraph1': 'Setting a low minimum order amount and charging lower delivery costs could attract new customers. Have you considered doing this already? It could increase your orders. Remember, we also offer the option of having different delivery costs per delivery area on our website.',
				'section3_title': 'Expand your delivery area',
				'section3_paragraph1': 'We know that you prefer fast, close to your restaurant deliveries, but extending your delivery area can have a great impact on orders. Increasing your delivery area just one kilometer might have a drastic influence on the number of orders you receive. Some areas are serviced quite well, while other areas  might have very few delivery options for customers. Starting delivery in areas with only a few other restaurants could be well worth the extra effort.',
				'section2_title': 'Adjust your delivery times & opening hours',
				'section2_paragraph1': 'Delivery times can have a big impact on your restaurant\'s success. We’ve noticed an increase in lunch orders and late-night orders. Because fewer restaurants are open during these hours, the ones which are open get a lot more orders on average per day. It might be worth a try to open for lunch, or to close an hour later. ',
