			'section_1': {
				'title': 'What is new?',
				'question_2': 'How can I switch back to the previous version?',
				'question_1': 'What has changed in the Partner Hub?',
				'answer_2': 'If you would like to switch back to the old version of the Restaurant Portal you can do so very easily. All you need to do is click on the \"go back to the old version\" button on the banner on top of every page.',
				'answer_1': 'The Partner Hub has now a new intuitive design and some extra added features. This version features a Dashboard where you have a clear overview of your restaurant. Here you can see the number of orders and the revenue, you can easily open and close your restaurant, review your ratings and menu items, and access our Webshop. All from one page.{br}\r\n{br}\r\nAlso, the \"Reporting\" section has been updated so you can easily find all the information you need about your restaurant\'s orders, invoices, online payments and more.{br}\r\n{br}\r\nFurthermore, the \"Marketing\" tab now offers tips and tricks on how to boost your restaurant, as well as some great tools to help you always be on top.',
			},
			'section_2': {
				'title': 'Account and Payment',
				'question_2': 'How will I get paid?',
				'question_1': 'I forgot my login credentials. What should I do?',
				'answer_2': 'Each Sunday, an invoice for the previous week is issued to you. Within five business days from the invoice issue date, a funds transfer is generated for all orders paid online, minus commission and administrative fees.',
				'answer_1': 'Your username and password can be found in the welcome letter you received from the Sales Team (by email or by mail), after joining @:(site_name). If you cannot find the document you can also contact our {customer_service} and they will send you the login details. ',
			},
			'section_3': {
				'title': 'Restaurant, menu and offers',
				'question_6': 'I want to make special offers for my clients. What type of discounts can I add?',
				'question_5': 'How can I mark products as sold out?',
				'question_4': 'Where can I see my invoices?',
				'question_3': 'Where can I see the orders for my restaurant?',
				'question_2': 'I want to make changes to my menu. Can I do that in the Partner Hub?',
				'question_1': 'I want to open\/close my restaurant. How can I do this?',
				'answer_6': 'You can always treat your customers with special offers and discounts. 25% off your fires, 50% off all the desserts or Pizza for only €5 for the wole month, these are just a few examples of wat you could offer to your customers.{br}\r\n{br}\r\nFind out all about the available offers and discounts in the \"Marketing\" tab of the Partner Hub.',
				'answer_5': 'You can mark dishes as sold out very easy. Just go to your Dashboard and click on \"Menu items\". This will redirect you to your Menu page where you can have an overview of your products. Above each product picture you can see a switch. By clicking this switch you can mark each product as sold out. Once the menu item comes back in stock, you can make it available online by clicking the same switch.',
				'answer_4': 'To see all your invoices please go to the \"Reporting\" page and click on the \"Invoices\" tab.',
				'answer_3': 'You can find an overview of your orders in the \"Reporting\" tab.',
				'answer_2': 'You can make changes to your menu at any point from the Dashboard of the Partner Hub. From there you can select \"Menu” and then you will see an overview of your restaurant\'s menu. Here you can make changes to your menu. If you would like to make other changes, such as adding or deleting product,  please contact our {customer_service}.',
				'answer_1': 'It is very easy to open\/close your restaurant. Simply go to the Partner Hub Dashboard and click the \"Restaurant open\/closed” switch at the top of the page. You can close the restaurant for the rest of the day, or for part of the day. Your restaurant will open again on the next day, according to your schedule. When you choose to close your restaurant for only one part of the day, it will automatically be open for the rest of the day.  If you want to close your restaurant longer than 1 day, please contact {customer_service}.',
			},
			'section_4': {
				'title': 'Webshop',
				'question_3': 'The product I am looking for is out of stock. When will it be available again?',
				'question_2': 'What can I order and how can I pay for my products?',
				'question_1': 'What is the @:(site_name) Webshop?',
				'answer_3': 'If the product you are looking for is not in stock, you can always choose to be notified when it becomes available. All you need to do is click on the \"Keep me posted\" button and confirm your email address. Once the product comes back in stock you will receive an email about it.',
				'answer_2': '{webshop_url} truly has everything you need for your restaurant. From food to kitchen appliances, disposables to delivery bags and vehicles, promotional items to hygene products, we offer a wide range of restaurant and delivery specific products. The webshop is developed to make your life easy, reason why we are constantly improving and diversifying our assortiment.\r\nAfter choosing the desired products, you can easily place an order and receive the products at your door. There are 2 ways to pay for your order:{br}\r\n1. If you ordered products from @:(site_name) only, the value of your order will be added to your weekly collective invoice and deducted from your weekly profits.{br}\r\n2. If your order contains external vendor products, then you will receive an invoice immediately after placing the order. Make sure you are respecting all payment conditions.',
				'answer_1': 'The @:(site_name) webshop has been developed to offer our restaurant partners extra value. The whole idea behind it is to offer our partners a place where they can find everything they need for their restaurants at amazing prices. Because the webshop has no profit motive, our restaurants always come first. We are constantly expanding our assortiment and negotiating better prices, extra discounts, free shipping, and other offers, so that you can take advantage of the best prices. Score competitive deals and save time and money by ordering everything from our webshop. From food to disposables, kitchen appliances or  delivery vehicles, you can find them all in one place. You can access the webshop from your dashboard or by accessing {webshop_url}',
			},
			'section_5': {
				'title': 'Marketing tools',
				'question_5': 'Would you like to share your ideas or feedback on marketing with us?  ',
				'question_4': 'What is the HTML button and why should I use it?',
				'question_3': 'What is a MealDeal and how can I offer it to my clients?',
				'question_2': 'What is the StampCard program and how can I activate it?',
				'question_1': 'What is TopRank and why should I activate it?',
				'answer_5': 'We are in a continuous journey to grow and improve and we want to offer the best services for our partner restaurants. If you want to give us some feedback or you have a great idea about what we could add to our marketing package, we are happy to hear from you. Just contact our {customer_service} and we will make sure your voice is heard.',
				'answer_4': 'The HTML button is a replacement for the WordPress plugin and it helps you direct customers from your website to your @:(site_name) page, where they can place an order. If you have a website, then all you need to do is download the HTML manual and implement it on your website.',
				'answer_3': 'A MealDeal is a predefined set of a one-person meal and a partner product at a fixed price. For example, a Pizza MealDeal would consist of a pizza (eg.:Margherita,Quatro Stagioni, etc.) and a drink(eg.:Fanta, Coca Cola) for the price of 7.50 eur.\r\n{br}\r\n{br}\r\nYou can activate MealDeals in the \"Marketing\" tab, by selecting the meal you want to activate in the MealDeals page.',
				'answer_2': 'StampCard is a new program designed to make customers loyal to your restaurant. Every time a customer places an order at your restaurant, he receives a stamp.\r\n{br}\r\n{br}\r\nOnce the customer has collected 5 stamps, he receives a voucher with a value of 10% of the total order amount of these five orders. This voucher can only be used at your restaurant.\r\n{br}\r\n{br}\r\nYou can find more information and activate the StampCard program in the \"Marketing\" tab.',
				'answer_1': 'TopRank is a new marketing tool that allows you to improve your position on our platform with just 2 clicks. It\'s fast, easy and simple to use. Just select how high you want to move in the search results and click on the button “Get this rank”. You can buy a better position at any time, so we advise you to check your results daily.',
			},
			'section_6': {
				'title': 'TopRank',
				'question_9': 'How do I cancel my TopRank position?',
				'question_8': 'Will I be notified when my position changes?',
				'question_7': 'Who are my competitors?',
				'question_6': 'Where can I find my current and previous positions?',
				'question_5': 'When do I pay?',
				'question_4': 'How much does TopRank cost?',
				'question_3': 'How do I upgrade my TopRank position?',
				'question_2': 'How is my position defined?',
				'question_1': 'What is TopRank?',
				'answer_9': 'If you wish to cancel your TopRank position, go to the TopRank page and scroll down the list of restaurants until you reach your original position. Then click on the button “Downgrade” next to it. Note that by doing this, you will be immediately moved down in the search results and you will be less visible for your customers.',
				'answer_8': 'Currently, you won’t receive any notifications from us for the updates of your position. We’re constantly working to improve our service, so we hope this feature will be available soon.',
				'answer_7': 'The competitors list represents all restaurants that deliver to the same areas as you do. To make it easier for you, we’ve added filtering option for Small, Medium and Big competitors. These will narrow the list with restaurants based on the percent of overlapping in the delivery areas. Like this, you know exactly who you are running up against.',
				'answer_6': 'You can keep track on the changes you’ve made to your sorting position, the number of orders and the fee you have to pay in the Position Overview tab. By default, you are going to see the last 10 changes. If you want to see previous period, just select the relevant week or month.',
				'answer_5': 'The costs for TopRank will be added to your weekly invoice and deducted from your revenue.',
				'answer_4': 'The fee you will pay will vary, depending on the position you select. The fee is always displayed next to the position. Like this, you will  know the exact costs of each position before making your decision.\r\n{br}\r\n{br}\r\nThe total amount for each week is calculated by number of orders and it is added to your weekly invoice. You will pay a fee per each order you receive. Note that you can check your current spending at any time in the \"Position Overview\" tab.',
				'answer_3': 'Just select how high you want to move in the search results and click on the button “Upgrade”. Then all you have to do is to confirm the order. Once you adjusted your position, you’ll start paying a fee per each order, generated from @:(site_name).This fee will be added to your weekly invoice.',
				'answer_2': 'Your TopRank position is dynamic and is defined based on your overall performance, such as the number of orders and quality of reviews. The better it is, the higher you\'ll appear in the search results and the less you\'ll need to pay for upgrading your position through TopRank. For your convenience, we have added a default preview of your final ranking for your own address. You can switch back to the list with all competitors by selecting it from the drop down menu.\r\n{br}\r\n{br}\r\nNote that all changes that you make in any of the 2 lists will have a direct impact on the other list as well.',
				'answer_1': '@:(site_name) statistics show that a higher position on the restaurant overview on @:(site_name) results in more orders. TopRank is a new marketing tool that allows you to improve your sorting position with just 2 clicks. It is fast, easy and simple to use. Just select how high you want to move in the search results and click on the button “Upgrade”.\r\n{br}\r\n{br}\r\nThe fee you will pay for TopRank will vary, depending on the position you select. The amount you have to pay (per order) is always displayed next to every position. Like this, you will  know the exact costs of each position before making your decision.{br}\r\n{br}\r\nThe total amount for each week is calculated by number of orders and it is added to your weekly invoice. Note that you can check your current spending at any time in the \"Position Overview\" tab.You can buy a better sorting position at any time, so we advise you to check your results daily.',
			},
			'section_7': {
				'title': 'Waiting Times',
				'question_6': 'How can I avoid ‘Restaurant Caused Waiting Time’?',
				'question_5': 'Why is RCWT important to my restaurant?',
				'question_4': 'What is my scheduled pickup time?',
				'question_3': 'What isn’t considered RCWT?',
				'question_2': 'What is ‘Restaurant Caused Waiting Time’ (RCWT)?',
				'question_1': 'What is Waiting Time?',
				'answer_6': 'It’s essential to give your customers the best experience so they keep coming back for more. Ensure food is always ready at the communicated pickup time, so couriers and your customers are never left waiting.\r\n{br}\r\n{br}\r\nAvoid ‘Restaurant Caused Waiting Times’ by speaking with your Account Manager. They will discuss your historical performance and give you tips on how to optimise your system settings.',
				'answer_5': 'Delivery times are influential to a customer’s decision to reorder from you. Orders running late fail to meet customer expectations and can affect their satisfaction. Ensuring that orders are always delivered on time can positively increase customer loyalty and retention - meaning you increase your orders in the long run.\r\n{br}\r\n{br}\r\nRCWT also affects the time the courier arrives at the next restaurant. We encourage all partners to avoid RCWT so it doesn’t affect other partners and in turn doesn’t affect your restaurant.',
				'answer_4': 'This is the time that an order should be fully ready for pickup by the courier. ',
				'answer_3': 'RWCT refers only to the time the courier is waiting for the order after arriving at the restaurant at the scheduled pickup time. It does not include the time the courier spends waiting before the scheduled pickup time.',
				'answer_2': '‘Restaurant Caused Waiting Time’ is the total time a courier spends waiting at a restaurant due to the restaurant providing the order later than the scheduled pickup time.',
				'answer_1': '‘Waiting Time’ is the total amount of time a courier spends waiting for an order while at the restaurant. This wait may be caused by a courier arriving too early, or a restaurant providing the order later than expected.',
			},
			'section_8': {
				'title': 'KYC Reassessment',
				'question_9': 'What happens if I do not provide the documents?',
				'question_8': 'What happens after I provide the documents?',
				'question_7': 'How can I send the documents to you in a safe way?',
				'question_6': 'Which documents are required for this process?',
				'question_5': 'Are there any actions required by me?',
				'question_4': 'I already provided all documents in the past (when we started), why do I have to provide new documents at this moment?',
				'question_3': 'Is there a legal basis for this process?',
				'question_2': 'Why is the process necessary?',
				'question_10': 'How often are you going to do this?',
				'question_1': 'What is the Know Your Customer process?',
				'answer_9': 'If the required documents are not provided, we are unfortunately unable to continue accepting online payments on your behalf via our platform.',
				'answer_8': 'After the documents have been provided, our team will assess if we have all documents to complete the reassessment  If nothing is required, we will internally update the information and send a confirmation via email that all is okay. If anything additional is required, we will reach out to you via email and phone call to request the additional documents.',
				'answer_7': 'All necessary documents can be securely uploaded via the portal at {verification_page} or they can be sent to us via an answer on the email we sent to you about this topic. We care about your personal data, and are committed to protecting and safeguarding any personal data you\'ve provided to us. Therefore, there is a limited and dedicated team of people that has access to these documents to process the necessary data. ',
				'answer_6': 'Due to the nature of the KYC process and differences between cases, we do not always require the same exact documents to complete the reassessment. If any documents are required in the process, we will reach out to you with a list of required documents via e-mail.',
				'answer_5': 'In many cases, we are able to carry out all the KYC reassessment checks without any additional documentation. In these cases, there are no further actions required. Unfortunately, this is not always the case (e.g. because data is not publicly available) so it might be that we reach out to you via email (or the restaurant portal) to request additional documentation in the process. ',
				'answer_4': 'A full assessment has indeed taken place during the sign up of the restaurant, however, during the lifespan of a restaurant changes in ownership and\/or the ownership structure might occur. To establish that we are still dealing with the same partners, we have established a process where we periodically reassess the restaurant account, which is called the reassessment. For us to conclude this assessment, we need up-to-date documentation.',
				'answer_3': 'This procedure is enforced by the European Union Directive against Money Laundering and Terrorist Financing and the financial regulator that supervises Takeaway.com Payments and its national laws. This is enforced due to the fact that Takeaway.com Payments B.V., an affiliate of @:(site_name), has a license as payment services provider. And thus is allowed to process online payments on our platform for our partners.',
				'answer_2': 'The KYC process is necessary to ensure that we as a company do not transfer funds to people and entities that are sanctioned parties and\/or might have ill intent which might hurt the financial system and our platform by using our platform for Money Laundering or the Financing of Terrorism. This is also in accordance with the European Anti Money Laundering Directives (AMLD)',
				'answer_10': 'We are carrying out the process periodically. However, the frequency might differ per case and we do not need additional information or documentation in every case. Therefore, we will only notify you in case any additional information or documentation is required.',
				'answer_1': 'The KYC (Know Your Customer) process is a procedure to verify restaurants cooperating with @:(site_name). Its aim is to identify the ultimate beneficiary and to verify bank accounts to which funds from orders paid online are transferred. \r\n\r\nThe process starts during the onboarding, where we collect various documents to identify the legal structure of your restaurants, the ultimate beneficial owners (UBOs) and the legal representatives (LRs). Next to this, we verify the identities of the UBOs and the LRs. This is done via various means, such as the sign up form, Chamber of Commerce documents and UBO forms. \"',
			},
		},
